601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102613","id":2646191601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dua3x","user":{"login":"oijqws","id":38936048,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTM2MDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38936048?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws","html_url":"https://github.com/oijqws","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oijqws/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-09T11:43:43Z","updated_at":"2025-02-09T11:43:43Z","body":"thanks, if so, what is the recommanded way flip a node left to right?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646191601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646603562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102613#issuecomment-2646603562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102613","id":2646603562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dv_cq","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-09T21:13:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-09T21:13:33Z","body":"You can use a shader to flip your sprite as alternative to scale:\n\nAdd this shader to your `AnimatedSprite2D`:\n\n```\nshader_type canvas_item;\nuniform bool flip_sprite = false;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n\tif (flip_sprite) {\n\t\tvec4 pc = textureLod(TEXTURE, vec2(1.0 - UV.x, UV.y), 1.0);\n\t\tCOLOR = pc;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nAnd use `animated_sprite_2d.material.set_shader_parameter(\"flip_sprite\", true)` to flip or pass false to unflip.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646603562/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647474680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102613#issuecomment-2647474680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102613","id":2647474680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dzUH4","user":{"login":"oijqws","id":38936048,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTM2MDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38936048?v=4","grava